What MRI-Lab Graz changed
-------------------------
Bug fixes for running bidspm v4.0.0 with SPM 26 on Octave (bidspm_overrides/ and
containers/dockerfile/patches/ in https://github.com/MRI-Lab-Graz/bidspm). They modify bidspm and are
distributed under the same licence, GPL-3.0. The combined program is conveyed under GPL-3.0
(OCI label org.opencontainers.image.licenses="GPL-3.0-only").

Removed for licence reasons (not in this image)
-----------------------------------------------
Only clearly free/open-source content is shipped. Removed: every atlas (Neuromorphometrics labels -- CC BY-NC;
AAL3, visfAtlas, Wang visual topography and Yeo networks -- no licence; Glasser HCP-MMP1.0 and HCPex -- HCP data
use terms), SPM's TSSS toolbox (non-commercial only), the CTF, RICOH and YOKOGAWA MEG readers (custom
permission / EULA), three Brainstorm files marked "for research purposes only", unlicensed File Exchange
helpers, and bidspm's test/demo data and git history. Evidence for each: docs/third-party-licenses.md in the
source repository. To use an atlas, build a derived image with your own copy (README, "Atlases").

